<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 1634) <span class="when">Oct 15, 2026</span></h2>
<ul>
<li><b>A through edit joined on an upper track is a layer, not a shot.</b> Joined over a shot below, it is one layer of that shot with one plate over its pieces (PL02 under the joined PL01), listed under the layer&#8217;s row. Split undoes it. Before, it became a second shot at the same time in the cut.</li>
<li><b>Develop Camera Raw says why when there is nothing to develop:</b> clips that play from their proxies, with Use Camera Originals and Locate Media&#8230; to choose from.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
